{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17955","headline":"同冠峡 · 韩愈","name":"同冠峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南方二月半，春物亦已少。\n维舟山水间，晨坐听百鸟。\n宿云尚含姿，朝日忽升晓。\n羇旅感和鸣，囚拘念轻矫。\n潺湲泪久迸，诘曲思增绕。\n行矣且无然，盖棺事乃了。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}